  "notes": "Mouwasat Medical Services Company (ticker 4002) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/433_0_2026-03-26...). Auditor: KPMG Professional Services Company (auditor's report Al Khobar, 6 Shawwal 1447H / 25 March 2026). The Board of Directors approved the consolidated financial statements on 22 Ramadan 1447H, corresponding to 11 March 2026 (Note 39). Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). The five primary statements (printed pages 1-5 of the FS) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group with non-controlling interests; no discontinued operations and no held-for-sale disposal groups. revenue combines 'Medical services revenue' and 'Pharmaceutical sales'; cost_of_revenue combines 'Cost of operations' and 'Cost of sales'. impairment_charges is the 'Reversal / (impairment) loss on accounts receivables' P&L line - a positive figure in FY2025 (a net reversal of SAR 9.83m) and a charge in FY2024 (SAR -78.41m). other_income and other_expense are the two separate P&L lines (FY2025 other expenses were nil). operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit'; finance_income is 'Interest income on term deposits'; finance_costs is the 'Finance cost' line (expensed, net of SAR 35.31m capitalised borrowing costs disclosed in Note 7.4). income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Profit before zakat'; income_taxes_and_zakat is the single 'Zakat expense' line (the group pays zakat, not income tax). other_noncurrent_assets combines the non-current 'Lease receivable' and 'Advances to contractors and suppliers'. prepayments combines 'Advances, prepayments and other current assets' and the current portion of lease receivable. short_term_investments is the FY2024 'Term deposits' line (nil at FY2025 year-end). other_reserves is the 'Other reserve' (the statutory reserve; transfers from retained earnings shown in the statement of changes in equity). other_noncurrent_liabilities is the non-current 'Retention payable'. related_party_payables is 'Due to related parties'; accrued_expenses is 'Accruals and other current liabilities'; other_current_liabilities is the IFRS 15 'Refund liability'. current_debt is the 'Current portion of long-term borrowings'; zakat_payable is 'Provision for zakat'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation on property and equipment', 'Depreciation on right-of-use assets' and 'Amortization of intangible assets' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Purchase of property and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Finance cost paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid' to the Company's shareholders (a separate SAR 36.75m / 29.40m was paid to non-controlling interests). The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 1, profit or loss and OCI 2, changes in equity 3, cash flows 4-5.",
